##INFO_ALIAS
$(NORMAL)You can define shortcommands with ALIAS.

$(COL{2})For example: $(COL{3})$(BOLD)ALIAS x=BRETT #$(NORMAL)

$(NORMAL)Everytime you enter "x", "BRETT #" will be executed.

$(NORMAL)$(COL{2})Parameters: $(COL{3})$(BOLD)%%p$(NORMAL)

$(COL{2})For example: $(COL{3})$(BOLD)ALIAS x=LESEN %%p$(NORMAL)

"x 100" will execute "LESEN 100".\n\n
